# One request (or a few) per pattern. Watch the X-Cache, Cache-Control, ETag and Age response headers.
# Full walkthrough: docs/pattern-map.md
@api = http://localhost:5080/api

### Catalog: cache-aside (MISS, then HIT)
GET {{api}}/catalog/products/5

### Catalog: conditional GET (304 Not Modified)
GET {{api}}/catalog/products/5
If-None-Match: "v1"

### Catalog: negative caching (404 MISS, then 404 HIT)
GET {{api}}/catalog/products/9999

### Catalog: id-list caching + generations + batched MGET (PARTIAL when only some products are cached)
GET {{api}}/catalog/products?category=books&page=1&pageSize=5

### Catalog: write-around + key delete + generation bump, then ProductChanged
POST {{api}}/catalog/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Kettle", "category": "food", "price": 12.5 }

### Catalog: write-around + delayed double delete; If-Match gives 412 when stale
PUT {{api}}/catalog/products/5
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "v1"

{ "name": "Renamed Lamp", "category": "books", "price": 10 }

### Catalog: immutable content-addressed image (copy imageUrl from a product)
GET {{api}}/catalog/images/REPLACE_WITH_HASH

### Customers: read-through
GET {{api}}/customers/3

### Customers: write-through with versioned compare-and-set (next GET is a fresh HIT)
PUT {{api}}/customers/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ada Lovelace", "email": "ada@example.com" }

### Pricing: refresh-ahead + upstream-capped TTL (after 60s a HIT also triggers a background refresh)
GET {{api}}/pricing/exchange-rates/usd

### Pricing: negative caching of an unknown currency
GET {{api}}/pricing/exchange-rates/xyz

### Pricing: soft/hard TTL (STALE after 30s while a background refresh runs)
GET {{api}}/pricing/currencies

### Pricing: memoization (see the memoization lookups in the metrics)
GET {{api}}/pricing/tax?country=DE&category=books&amount=100

### Inventory: leases
GET {{api}}/inventory/10

### Inventory: write, then revoke entry + lease
POST {{api}}/inventory/10/adjustments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delta": -1 }

### Carts: sliding expiration (each read resets the idle timer)
GET {{api}}/carts/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Carts: write-around
POST {{api}}/carts/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 7, "quantity": 1 }

### Analytics: write-behind (202; reaches the database within 10s)
POST {{api}}/analytics/products/3/views

### Analytics: TTL-only + probabilistic early expiration
GET {{api}}/analytics/trending?limit=5

### Reports: output cache (replays carry an Age header), evicted by ProductChanged / StockChanged
GET {{api}}/reports/catalog-overview

### ReferenceData: two-level cache, warmed at startup
GET {{api}}/reference-data/countries

### ReferenceData: L2 delete + pub/sub broadcast of the L1 eviction
PUT {{api}}/reference-data/countries/TR
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Türkiye", "currency": "TRY" }
